POST {{baseUrl}}/api/subjects/{{tap101}}/prerequisites
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prerequisiteSubjectId": {{tap201}}
}

> {%
    client.test("409 Conflict", () => client.assert(response.status === 409));
%}

### 12. Una asignatura como prerrequisito de si misma -> espera 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/subjects/{{tap201}}/prerequisites
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prerequisiteSubjectId": {{tap201}}
