### 13. Prerrequisito inexistente -> espera 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/subjects/{{tap201}}/prerequisites
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prerequisiteSubjectId": 999999
}

> {%
    client.test("404 Not Found", () => client.assert(response.status === 404));
%}

### 14. Body sin prerequisiteSubjectId -> espera 400 con el mapa de errores por campo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/subjects/{{tap201}}/prerequisites
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

> {%
    client.test("400 Bad Request", () => client.assert(response.status === 400));
%}

### 15. No se puede borrar TAP101 porque es prerrequisito de TAP201 -> espera 409
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/subjects/{{tap101}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

> {%
    client.test("409 Conflict", () => client.assert(response.status === 409));
%}

